==Trivia==
*The Relic Doge Base is one of the five non-[[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemies to have the Curse ability, the others being [[Master Uril (Enemy)|Master Uril]], [[Malevolent Dark Cat]], [[Cafeteria Cat (Enemy)|Cafeteria Cat]] and [[Sage of Selection Darvin]].
**Relic Doge Base is exceptional among these, as they resemble a Relic enemy and are only not one because bases cannot have standard traits.

